{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfor p in ['data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T205123-6b8e9a16/P02/approved-plan.json','data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T201419-9b58ed81/P02/approved-plan.json','data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T181809-4cb566e0/P02/approved-plan.json']:\n d=json.loads(Path(p).read_text()); print(p, list(d))\n if 'plan' in d:\n  for k in ['steps','checks']: print(k,d['plan'].get(k))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T205123-6b8e9a16/P02/approved-plan.json ['plan', 'review', 'plan_hash']\nsteps ['1. Resume the existing repair. Update progress.md with the verified current state: module repairs exist, the saved case is stale, eight of nine baseline tests pass, and result.md is missing. Capture hashes of affected and protected files. Preserve successful extraction, reconciliation and unrelated work; do not restart acquisition or whole-project discovery.', '2. Establish focused regression tests for the partial repairs. Independently locate substantive indenture Sections 501 and 502 and distinguish them from the prospectus summary, table of contents and cross-references. Verify that annual Exhibit 4.1 support contains actual securities-description contents separately from its index entry. Retain series-specific qualifications and downgrade any unsupported interpretation.', '3. Complete source-relationship validation. Test interim note membership against real raw HTML boundaries and fact anchors, preserving extraction identities. Require the complete linked source span to lie within its note; reject incorrect assignments and extraction offsets. Exercise independently parsed issuer cells by statement, label, period and column; reject ambiguous rows, altered values, incorrect dates and columns. Repair the module only where these checks expose defects.', '4. Preserve all original case obligations while rebuilding: all 23 anchored note dispositions with linked quantities or explicit unresolved meaning; policies, management assertions and cross-references; annual/interim and comparative balance sheets; principal-to-carrying and current/noncurrent debt; rounded interim debt; separate product and geographic revenue partitions; PP&E; and dated cash-flow bridges. Keep incorporation targets, acquired-source provenance, publication uncertainty and unidentified histories explicit.', '5. Extend independent arithmetic and source checks. Obtain fresh annual PDF text through pdftotext stdout and check selected rows independently of the builder. Specify debt, revenue, PP&E and cash-flow arithmetic from those source readings and retained interim facts. Test missing, duplicate and reordered notes; broken boundaries; altered quotations and hashes; broken fact/context/unit IDs; currency, entity, date, scale, sign and perimeter mutations; duplicate dimensions; and conflicting repeated readings. Require each negative test to fail for its intended reason.', '6. Finish mandatory numerical and temporal edge cases. Reject mixed product/geography aggregation, fair-value or notional substitution for carrying debt, and balance-sheet cash substituted for cash including restricted cash. Test exact rounding endpoints and genuinely incompatible intervals with otherwise valid operands, separately from source-integrity rejection. Test unknown byte availability, exclusion of later proxy evidence at earlier filing cutoffs, conflicting versions retained without automatic supersession, and metadata tampering against unchanged source bytes.', '7. Review retained official proxy, issuer filing, registration and acquisition evidence against each outstanding incorporation/version obligation. Record the exact missing instrument or evidence, consequence and legitimate next source route. If access is unavailable, record it once and continue independent repairs; do not fabricate publication timestamps, infer historical byte vintage from selected-table agreement or claim complete agreement reconstruction.', '8. Before the final reserve, regenerate case.json and write result.md. Include the deterministic evidence contract, material default/assumption audit, actual commands and outcomes, environment/tool versions, available Git provenance or its absence, elapsed time, input/output paths, changed-file hashes and original/recovery plan provenance. Add the required decision table covering primary criteria, vetoes, uncertainty, next action and nonclaims. Separate specified behavior, implementation, tested invariants, selected accounting identities, unevaluated forecasting and pending human acceptance.', '9. Execute sequentially: timeout 120s python3 -B scripts/apple_case_v1.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02; timeout 120s python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_accounting_p02.py -v; timeout 120s python3 -B scripts/apple_case_v1.py --check --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02. Fix failures, compare a second in-memory build with the saved case, verify protected-file hashes and inspect result.md against actual outcomes. Update progress.md. Reserve 120 seconds for final verification/reporting; unfinished mandatory checks prevent an implementation acceptance claim.']\nchecks ['Read the full prior approved recovery steps, prior plan-review response and original mandatory verification requirements; inspected current implementation, tests, checkpoint and saved case.', 'Ran timeout 120s python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_accounting_p02.py -v: eight tests passed and one failed in 7.331 seconds. The CLI check rejects case.json because it differs from the current source-derived rebuild.', 'A read-only in-memory build succeeded with 13 annual notes, 10 interim notes, 125 observations, 34 bridges and 698 anchors. Counts establish coverage of the bounded inventory, not semantic completeness.', 'The current build selects substantive Section 501 at offsets 190993–194649, anchors annual Exhibit 4.1 contents, records ten raw HTML note boundaries and independently parses six issuer statement values.', 'The saved case differs from the current build in notes, external evidence, representation comparison and anchor count. Its Section 501 still starts at the obsolete prospectus-summary offset 42968.', 'Skeptical audit: continue from the repaired module, not the stale saved case. Source agreement, independent arithmetic and intended adversarial rejection determine acceptance; test counts and note counts do not. Missing sources, ambiguous extraction, invalid contexts, failed identities or missing mandatory tests veto completion and trigger repair. External access limitations restrict dependent claims without stopping independent work. No performance comparison or scientific promotion is proposed.']\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T201419-9b58ed81/P02/approved-plan.json ['plan', 'review', 'plan_hash']\nsteps ['1. Continue from the approved plan and current partial implementation. Create a concise progress.md immediately in the implementation role, recording the verified baseline, defects above and next checks. Capture hashes of affected inputs and protected files. Restrict edits to scripts/apple_case_v1.py, tests/test_accounting_p02.py and P02 case.json, result.md and progress.md; add versioned source files only if necessary. Preserve existing successful extraction and reconciliation behavior.', '2. Repair contract and exhibit support. Select the substantive Section 501 within the retained Exhibit 4.1 indenture, excluding its table of contents, cross-references and prospectus summary; terminate at the substantive Section 502. Keep any useful summary as a separately labelled source. Anchor actual retained contents for the annual securities-description exhibit, or downgrade its status if only index evidence is verified. Recheck that interpretations follow the selected passages, including series-specific qualifications.', '3. Strengthen reusable source relationships. Verify interim note-to-fact membership through actual HTML note boundaries and original fact anchors, retaining extraction-specific offsets; reject an assigned quantity outside its note. Parse the selected issuer statement cells independently by table, label and period, then compare exact scaled values with annual observations. Remove authored numeric literals as the matching oracle. Reject ambiguous rows, wrong columns, context mismatches and unsupported interpretations.', '4. Preserve all original case obligations. Retain 13 annual and 10 interim source-bounded dispositions, linked quantities or specific unresolved meanings, management assertions, policy qualifications and cross-references. Preserve every existing bridge family: annual/interim balance sheets and comparatives, principal/carrying/current/noncurrent debt, rounded interim debt, separate product and segment revenue partitions, PP&E and dated cash-flow bridges. Retain source-bound external targets, acquisition provenance, date-resolution availability and unidentified histories. Inspect existing retained public-source evidence first; record any inaccessible capability once without bypass, fabricated timestamps or repeated polling.', '5. Extend tests with independent evidence. Assert selected PDF rows using fresh pdftotext output and independently specify expected debt, revenue, PP&E and cash-flow arithmetic. Add source-boundary tests distinguishing contract text from summary/index/TOC text and verifying note membership. Add table-column/value mutations, missing/reordered notes, wrong extraction offsets, broken fact/context/unit IDs, entity/currency/date/scale/sign/perimeter mutations, duplicate dimensions and conflicting repeated facts. Test mixed product/geography aggregation, fair-value/notional substitution, restricted-cash perimeter, exact rounding endpoints and incompatible intervals. Ensure each negative test fails for its intended reason, not an unrelated malformed field.', \"6. Complete temporal and provenance tests. Test unknown retained-byte availability, proxy evidence excluded before its filing date, multiple retained conflicting versions without automatic supersession, and metadata tampering against unchanged source bytes. Preserve P01's distinct interim extraction identity. Treat selected-table agreement as representation evidence only; do not infer whole-document equivalence or historical byte vintage.\", '7. Generate and document the repaired result before the final reserve. Write result.md with the deterministic evidence contract and assumption audit, actual commands/outcomes, changed source/code/test paths and hashes, environment/tool versions, unavailable Git provenance, elapsed time, input/output paths and approved-plan plus recovery-plan provenance. Include a decision table covering primary criteria, vetoes, uncertainties, next actions and nonclaims. Separate specified behavior, implementation, tested invariants, selected accounting identities, unevaluated forecasting and pending human acceptance. Run the listed checks, fix failures, update progress.md, and report exact unfinished work if the budget expires.']\nchecks ['Executed timeout 120s python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_accounting_p02.py -v: all nine tests passed in 7.280 seconds, including the read-only CLI rebuild.', 'Verified actual case coverage: 13 annual notes, 10 interim notes, 125 observations, 34 reconciliations, 614 anchors and explicit unresolved meanings for all 23 notes. These counts establish neither semantic completeness nor accounting validity.', 'Verified acquired-file hashes against acquisition.json. Retained proxy, issuer annual filing and 2021 registration originals exist. Both result.md and progress.md are absent.', 'Skeptical audit: retain pinned sources as the baseline; reject authored totals and coverage counts as acceptance substitutes. Missing required anchors, ambiguous extraction, invalid contexts, failed arithmetic or missing mandatory tests veto completion. External access limitations constrain dependent claims without stopping independent repairs. No stochastic comparison or accelerator dependency applies.', 'After repair, run timeout 120s python3 -B scripts/apple_case_v1.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02, then timeout 120s python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_accounting_p02.py -v, then timeout 120s python3 -B scripts/apple_case_v1.py --check --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02.', 'Verify deterministic output with a second in-memory build comparison; verify protected-file hashes against the implementation-entry baseline. Inspect result.md against actual command outcomes and source evidence before returning IMPLEMENTED.']\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T181809-4cb566e0/P02/approved-plan.json ['plan', 'review', 'plan_hash']\nsteps ['1. Establish the input and write boundaries. Read the accepted P01 register, Apple originals, extracted text, manifest and retained SEC submissions index. Recheck hashes and bind each original to its extraction and document identity. Create scripts/apple_case_v1.py and tests/test_accounting_p02.py. Write only case.json and result.md under data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02. Any newly acquired sources go into a new docs/design/cases/apple/p02-v1/ directory. Preserve existing builders, manifests, snapshots, benchmark files and controller files.', '2. Implement reusable source-anchor and extraction functions. Annual anchors must include original/extraction hashes, PDF page, printed page where identifiable, exact text offsets and quotation; retain table headers and selected column locations. Interim extraction must resolve inline-XBRL fact, context and unit IDs from the retained HTML, including entity, instant/duration, dimensions, currency, scale, sign, decimals and supported transformation. Validate extracted values against rendered labels/text. Reject missing, ambiguous or unsupported interpretations rather than guessing. Keep source readings, annotations and derived results separate.', '3. Build the 23-note disposition layer from actual source spans. Independently discover note boundaries, reconcile them with the inventory and exclude following auditor/MD&A sections. Give every note explicit linked quantities or a specific unresolved meaning, affected model areas, qualifications and cross-reference targets. Replace the generic interim Contingencies treatment with an anchored management assertion whose uncertainty is preserved without inventing a probability or zero liability. Record annual/interim policy differences from their own passages. Report inventory, numerical coverage and semantic coverage separately.', '4. Implement context validation and exact reconciliation using Fraction or Decimal, with no binary-float tolerance. Select facts by concept, reporting date/period, entity, perimeter, dimensions, measurement basis and unit. Check annual/comparative/interim balance-sheet identities; annual principal-to-carrying and current/noncurrent debt bridges; interim statement debt against rounded narrative debt; annual and interim product/segment revenue totals separately against statement revenue; annual PP&E gross-to-net; and annual/interim cash-flow opening-plus-movements-to-closing balances. Preserve each operand’s source and explain every permitted context transformation.', '5. Implement rounding-aware comparisons. Retain displayed values and precision separately from inferred intervals. Encode 97,341 − 321 − 358 = 96,662 and 10,912 + 85,750 = 96,662 as displayed annual debt identities, and 10,848 + 83,956 = 94,804 as the interim identity. Verify 94,804 million is compatible with the displayed 94.8 billion under an explicitly recorded rounding model. Distinguish carrying amount, principal, fair value and derivative notional. For rounded aggregates, propagate operand intervals exactly; never conceal mismatches with a broad epsilon.', '6. Preserve unidentified histories explicitly. Link the disclosed fixed-rate debt, swap discussion and annual 14,575 million interest-rate notional while leaving contract allocation, reset dates, hedge coverage, interim exposure, asset cohorts and contingent outcomes unresolved where unsupported. Retain the existing financing stress only as a labelled conditional illustration, if included; do not promote its assumed exposure or zero-tax treatment into extracted facts. Do not manufacture a debt roll-forward from cash movements when FX, noncash and measurement movements remain unidentified.', '7. Investigate incorporation and publication obligations. Enumerate exact annual Part III and exhibit-index targets, distinguish material already inside the retained PDF from external documents, and preserve internal-reference closure separately. Use the retained SEC index to identify the 2025 proxy accession 0001308179-25-000008 and the annual/interim filing identities. Inspect legitimate SEC or issuer sources for the proxy and financing agreements relevant to this slice. Preserve acquired bytes, hashes, retrieval times and exact supporting spans. Give remaining obligations their target document/exhibit, version, missing terms, consequence and next legitimate retrieval route. Keep mirror availability distinct from filing availability; a selected-table match does not establish whole-PDF publication equivalence.', '8. Generate deterministic case.json containing source bindings, typed observations, all note dispositions, mappings, bridges, external obligations, availability records and unidentified-history records. Provide build and read-only --check CLI modes. result.md must record the pre-run evidence/default audit, actual commands, deterministic check results, changed-file hashes, environment, elapsed time, input/output paths, decision table and separate implementation/accounting/forecast/human-acceptance assessments. Use the reviewed phase packet as plan provenance; report unavailable Git provenance honestly.']\nchecks ['Skeptical audit: the plan replaces authored totals as truth with source-bound readings; guards against scale, sign, measurement and cash-perimeter mismatches; separates filing, retrieval and mirror availability; and uses deterministic rejection tests rather than semantic-coverage counts as promotion evidence. It avoids GPU/environment dependencies and contains no stochastic ranking.', 'Pre-run evidence contract: pass requires all 23 anchored note dispositions, successful supported bridges and expected adversarial rejections. Missing mandatory inputs, hash failures, ambiguous required extraction, unsupported context or failed arithmetic veto acceptance and trigger repair. External-access failure blocks only the unsupported incorporation/version claim; it must not erase independent completed work.', 'Run python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_accounting_p02.py -v. Tests must consume the real retained annual text/PDF and interim HTML, verify selected annual rows through independent pdftotext output, and use independently stated arithmetic expectations rather than importing expected results from the builder.', 'Test missing/duplicate notes, incorrect note boundaries, altered quotations and source hashes, broken fact/context/unit IDs, wrong scale/sign/currency/entity/perimeter/date, dimensional duplicates and conflicting repeated readings. Mutating supplied case metadata while leaving source bytes unchanged must fail revalidation.', 'Check the annual cash-flow opening balance of 30,737 against its own source perimeter; substituting balance-sheet cash of 29,965 must fail. Check product and geography partitions separately; combining both totals must fail. Reject substitution of fair value or derivative notional for debt carrying value.', 'Test compatible and incompatible rounded debt values, exact interval endpoints, unknown availability, later proxy evidence at earlier cutoffs and separately retained conflicting versions. No unknown publication timestamp may become a fabricated point timestamp.', 'Run python3 -B scripts/apple_case_v1.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02, then python3 -B scripts/apple_case_v1.py --check --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02. Require deterministic substantive output, valid source links and a report that preserves unresolved obligations.', 'Compare pre/post hashes of touched inputs and protected files; record every newly created source/code/test file. Run no controller, acquisition sweep, GPU diagnostic, background process or model worker.']\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
