 step.']\nwith (out/'result.md').open('a') as f:f.write('\\\\n'.join(lines)+'\\\\n')\nresult_hash=hashlib.sha256((out/'result.md').read_bytes()).hexdigest()\ncheckpoint='''# P02 completed implementation checkpoint\n\nRecovery findings verified: saved case was stale, result.md absent, and module repairs existed. The initial note-link validator checked only start offsets. Continued the approved recovery plan without new discovery or acquisition.\n\nChanged files in this recovery: scripts/apple_case_v1.py; tests/test_accounting_p02.py; data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02/case.json, result.md and progress.md. Added complete-span/same-extraction note containment, observation-source link validation, source-anchor checks before reconciliation, and recovery-plan provenance. Retained prior operative-indentures, Exhibit 4.1 and issuer-cell repairs.\n\nChecks completed: final source-derived build exit 0; 20 unittest cases pass; read-only CLI check passes for 23 notes, 125 observations, 34 bridges and 698 anchors. Independent tests read fresh PDF rows and original interim HTML, check arithmetic/context/source meaning and specific rejection reasons, and isolate exact rounding endpoints/incompatibility with valid synthetic fixtures. A further in-memory rebuild exactly equals case.json. All 211 recorded protected source/release/controller/snapshot hashes remain unchanged. No usable Git repository exists; no initialization attempted.\n\nResult.md records the pre-execution evidence/default/skeptical audit, actual commands, environment, wall times, file hashes, source obligations, decision table and nonclaims. Full local check outputs remain under /tmp/accdsl-p02-repair; required evidence is summarized in result.md.\n\nNo unfinished mandatory deliverable is known for this bounded implementation. Next step: independent review_result of actual adapter, tests, case and result. Acceptance is pending review. All wider G1–G18 obligations remain. Complete note semantics, additional indentures/series certificates, omitted instruments, historical retained-byte availability, debt/swap allocation, noncash movements, asset cohorts and contingent outcomes remain unresolved; forecasting and human acceptance are unevaluated.\n\nFinal result.md SHA256: '''+result_hash+'\\\\n'\n(out/'progress.md').write_text(checkpoint)\nprint('final files recorded; tests',count,'seconds',seconds,'worker elapsed',round(elapsed,1),'checkpoint words',len(checkpoint.split()))\nprint('result_sha256',result_hash)\nfor p in ['scripts/apple_case_v1.py','tests/test_accounting_p02.py','data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02/case.json']:\n assert hashlib.sha256(Path(p).read_bytes()).hexdigest() in (out/'result.md').read_text(),p\nprint('result hash rows match actual code/tests/case')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
